:name: edge-pm sim bring-up
:description: Boots the `--features sim` firmware on an emulated STM32F411 and runs the baked
:            bearing_stream through the on-device pipeline, latching then clearing an alert.
:
: Build the ELF first:  cd firmware && cargo build --features sim
: Run:                  renode firmware/renode/edge-pm.resc   (add `start` or run headless)

using sysbus
mach create "edge-pm"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/stm32f411.repl

# Mirror USART2 to the Renode console so the alert log is visible headless.
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2 Antmicro.Renode.Analyzers.LoggingUartAnalyzer

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF @target/thumbv7em-none-eabihf/debug/firmware
"""
runMacro $reset
